terminal-font-features

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Draw terminal text with the font's ligatures and the person's OpenType features and weights, as Ghostty does, instead of forcing calt, liga and dlig off and requesting Medium and Bold.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream herdr-app reads terminal font features and weights from settings and keeps ligatures on by default.
